pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: badge
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 300, 20]
    content:
      style: "$badge"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>ENERGY TRACK RESULTS</p>
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 65, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$pageTitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Edge-Level Spread Prediction: Strongest Relational Result</strong></p>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 115, 1160, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$midGray"
  - elementId: intro-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 130, 1160, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>A cross-border price spread <strong>does not exist for a single node</strong> — it is irreducibly relational. The GAT computes node embeddings; an MLP head predicts each border's next-day spread from the two endpoint embeddings and the current spread.</p>
  - elementId: table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 210, 700, 180]
    style: "$default"
    columnWidths: [0.28, 0.18, 0.20, 0.34]
    rowHeights: [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25]
    rows:
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p>Predictor</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>Skill</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>Rank IC</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>Note</p>
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p>edge_persistence</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>0.000</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>—</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>spread today (reference)</p>
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p>edge_ridge</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>0.192</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>0.67</p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>both endpoints' drivers + current spread</p>
      - - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>edge_gat</strong></p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>0.248</strong></p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p><strong>0.68</strong></p>
        - content:
            text: |
              <p>GAT embeddings → edge MLP (5-seed mean)</p>
  - elementId: result-card-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [800, 210, 420, 180]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: result-card-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 220, 380, 50]
    content:
      fontSize: 36
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>+0.056</strong></p>
  - elementId: result-card-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 275, 380, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |
        <p>skill gain over both-endpoint ridge</p>
        <p>~29% relative improvement</p>
  - elementId: result-card-seeds
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 340, 380, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>5 of 5 seeds</strong></p>
  - elementId: control-card-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 415, 1160, 90]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$lightGray"
  - elementId: control-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [80, 435, 28, 28]
    iconName: "fas:flask"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$secondary"
  - elementId: control-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [120, 425, 1080, 70]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Synthetic control inverts:</strong> On independent zones with no coupling, the same architecture is <strong>worse</strong> than the ridge. So the real-data gain is structure, not capacity.</p>
  - elementId: takeaway-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 530, 1160, 80]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [3000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: takeaway-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 540, 1120, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Project's strongest relational result:</strong> The GNN's value concentrates precisely on the target that cannot be defined without the relation — cross-border spreads.</p>
  - elementId: footer-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 680, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 685, 600, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Relational Alpha Factors · GAT Capstone</p>
  - elementId: footer-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1100, 685, 120, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>11</p>
